    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, i don't think there's any \"getting out\" of it. it's just how i am. every time i get my hopes up, i just crash harder. it feel like i'm just prolonging the inevitable misery. like i'm just dragging out a life that's already broken.",
