      "content": "i don't see the point in \"fertile ground\" or \"small shifts\" when the ground is just a bottomless pit. it's just exhausting. sometimes i look at it and it feels like the only way to actually stop the cycle—to finally just get some peace—is to stop trying altogether. like, if the machine is broken beyond repair, why keep running it?",
